## Task 1: first run with the code (a test helper bug, not a code bug)
test a_blake3_store_rehashes_to_sha256 ... FAILED
panicked at crates/slicefs-cli/tests/rehash_tests.rs:166:5: left: 0, right: 1 (snapshots before the rehash)
cause: the test helper open_fs did not give the loaded snapshots to the metadata store, so its commit wrote a root
segment with no snapshot record. Fix: open_fs calls set_snapshots, as a mount does. Then 2 passed.

